Now works properly on Android 15 and 16

• Fixed a bug that drew the app underneath the status and navigation bars, which could put the Save button out of reach.
• Assigning a key now names every key it sees, instead of silently ignoring some of them.
• Scroll distance can now be set per app, not just globally.
• Removed the Battery Saver quick settings tile — it could never show up on the firmwares it was meant for. Map Battery Saver to a key instead.
